  <item>
    <title>便秘：想释放却只能干等的感觉，我不想懂</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67908fec416760d935a4bc9a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67908fec416760d935a4bc9a</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 22 Jan 2025 07:43:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>便秘原因多样，从身体小状况到生活习惯，甚至药物都可能来捣乱。便秘带来的问题也是多种多样，腹胀、皮肤暗黄已是入门级问题，甚至拉屎太用力都会带来血压问题。改善便秘的方法到底有哪些？除了调整饮食和生活习惯我们还有哪些妙招吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎收听本期节目，主播在这里预祝您拉屎通畅。</span></p><span></span><p><span>“祝您拉屎通畅”不是一句玩笑，是真心的健康祝福（双手合十）。</span></p><span></span><p><span>shownote：</span></p><span></span><p><span>·关于原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="123">02:03</a> 便秘的定义：每个星期排便次数少于 3 次，并伴有大便干结、排便困难</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="173">02:53</a>为何女性便秘更为常见?</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="196">03:16</a>器质型便秘：肠道健康发出的安全警告</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="311">05:11</a>功能型便秘：提醒你该调整生活习惯了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="388">06:28</a>什么？出门旅游带来的环境变化，也会导致便秘？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="428">07:08</a>如果最近在吃这几类药物，也会带来便秘问题</span></p><span></span><p><span>·关于危害</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="459">07:39</a>便秘不仅仅是肚子难受，还会带来疾病风险</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="549">09:09</a>别看他不仅仅是拉不出来，还会向上影响肠道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="575">09:35</a>有心血管问题的老年人，排便千万别太用力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="634">10:34</a>主播被点名：便秘还会导致月经周期紊乱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="672">11:12</a>长期便秘，心理健康情况也会受到影响吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>·关于检查</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="772">12:52</a>肠道健康检查，排除器质性原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="832">13:52</a>进行结肠传输测试及排便造影，看看你的肠道蠕动能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="903">15:03</a>肠道菌群检测，通过菌群信息找到原因</span></p><span></span><p><span>·关于解决方案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="976">16:16</a>用药建议：乳果糖、和爽、利那洛肽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1014">16:54</a>乳果糖的作用原理及局限性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1138">18:58</a>轻断食对于便秘的改善作用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1218">20:18</a>广告里天花乱坠的益生元，到底对便秘有效吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1308">21:48</a>排便的作用：不仅是排除食物残渣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1354">22:34</a>为何便秘的严重程度会与年龄的增长呈正相关</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66fe5ad99cc90633c6448911/lp0CjWeTZwk4qbhDf8_GPgo35lxB.m4a" length="21377187" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:24:38</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkDSeuLqS73c28yKkNU2XmmKQy_I.jpg"/>
